		(property "Note" "Low side back into the boost reservoir. NOT a Zener active clamp across the FET (Nexperia AN50003 rates repetitive active clamp reliability-'Questionable', gate-oxide wear-out) and NOT a freewheel to battery (too slow -- the same problem the boost rail exists to fix on the opening side)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.SilkS")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "065081b8-abbe-4703-bb89-2ab29aea7b7b")
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Peak" "28.7 W instantaneous during turn-off, ~8x the 3.6 W average across all 9 events/second -- the pulse sizes this part, the average never would"
